{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18401","headline":"赋得春风扇微和 · 柳道伦","name":"赋得春风扇微和","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"青阳初入律，淑气应春风。\n始辨梅花里，俄分柳色中。\n依微开夕照，澹荡媚晴空。\n拂水生苹末，经岩触桂丛。\n稍抽兰叶紫，微吐杏花红。\n愿逐仁风布，将俾生植功。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"柳道伦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18401.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18401","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}